<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Price/Costco cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Price/Costco cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter cut its rating on PriceCostco Inc to neutral from accumulate, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
